# --- Emails (Resend free plan: 100 a day, 3,000 a month) ---
# EMAIL_TRANSPORT=console saves emails as files in .devmail/ for development. Use "resend" in production.
# RESEND_API_KEY, EMAIL_FROM (a sender on a domain verified in Resend) and CLINIC_NOTIFY_EMAIL are above.
# SIGNED_LINK_SECRET: 32+ random characters. Signs the "manage your booking" links. Changing it later breaks links in
# emails sent afterwards for older bookings, so set it once.
# SETUP_TOKEN: needed once in production to create the first administrator at /admin/setup.
SETUP_TOKEN=
